    ID              shift and go to state 7

    column_list                    shift and go to state 5

state 4

    (1) program -> query SEMICOLON .

    $end            reduce using rule 1 (program -> query SEMICOLON .)


state 5

    (2) query -> SELECT column_list . FROM STRING where_clause
    (5) column_list -> column_list . COMMA ID

    FROM            shift and go to state 8
    COMMA           shift and go to state 9


state 6

    (3) column_list -> STAR .

    FROM            reduce using rule 3 (column_list -> STAR .)
    COMMA           reduce using rule 3 (column_list -> STAR .)


state 7

    (4) column_list -> ID .

    FROM            reduce using rule 4 (column_list -> ID .)
    COMMA           reduce using rule 4 (column_list -> ID .)


state 8

    (2) query -> SELECT column_list FROM . STRING where_clause

    STRING          shift and go to state 10


state 9

    (5) column_list -> column_list COMMA . ID

    ID              shift and go to state 11


state 10

    (2) query -> SELECT column_list FROM STRING . where_clause
    (6) where_clause -> .
    (7) where_clause -> . WHERE condition

    SEMICOLON       reduce using rule 6 (where_clause -> .)
    WHERE           shift and go to state 13

    where_clause                   shift and go to state 12

state 11

    (5) column_list -> column_list COMMA ID .

    FROM            reduce using rule 5 (column_list -> column_list COMMA ID .)
    COMMA           reduce using rule 5 (column_list -> column_list COMMA ID .)


state 12

    (2) query -> SELECT column_list FROM STRING where_clause .

    SEMICOLON       reduce using rule 2 (query -> SELECT column_list FROM STRING where_clause .)


state 13

    (7) where_clause -> WHERE . condition
    (8) condition -> . condition AND condition
    (9) condition -> . condition OR condition
    (10) condition -> . ID OPERATOR value

    ID              shift and go to state 15

    condition                      shift and go to state 14

state 14

    (7) where_clause -> WHERE condition .
    (8) condition -> condition . AND condition
    (9) condition -> condition . OR condition

    SEMICOLON       reduce using rule 7 (where_clause -> WHERE condition .)
    AND             shift and go to state 16
    OR              shift and go to state 17


state 15

    (10) condition -> ID . OPERATOR value

    OPERATOR        shift and go to state 18


state 16

    (8) condition -> condition AND . condition
    (8) condition -> . condition AND condition
    (9) condition -> . condition OR condition
    (10) condition -> . ID OPERATOR value

    ID              shift and go to state 15

    condition                      shift and go to state 19

state 17

    (9) condition -> condition OR . condition
    (8) condition -> . condition AND condition
    (9) condition -> . condition OR condition
    (10) condition -> . ID OPERATOR value

    ID              shift and go to state 15

    condition                      shift and go to state 20

state 18

    (10) condition -> ID OPERATOR . value
